cret wars maybe even  who the villain could possibly be but as  far as those eight unreleased slots for  phase six go what could they possibly be  well fingers crossed that one of them is  going to be for a solo hulk project  rumors have been going around about  world war hulk for a while now and since  we've gotten everything from she-hulk it  does seem like that is very likely so if  that movie is coming up in the near  future and it looks like it is i would  expect that announcement and i would  expect a world war hulk type film to be  one of the slots for phase six next of  course is deadpool 3. we know deadpool  is coming and i am fully expecting an  announcement for deadpool 3 and ryan  reynolds to get up on stage at d23 in  fact i would be shocked if that didn't  happen now another one which is actually  kind of taking me by surprise and may  take other fans by surprise as well is  the possibility for a spider-man  announcement on the official poster for  this year's d23 there is a picture of  spider-man on it then on top of that  we've already seen banners for d23 for  this year that have spider-man on it as  well and this is really interesting  because sony has the rights to  spider-man but we know that kevin feige  has been working really closely with  them recently so maybe they got  permission to announce a new spider-man  movie at d23 after all it is the perfect  place and it's not like they're dropping  a trailer they're just doing an  announcement so fingers crossed for that  since we do have posters and banners it  looks like that could be a likely  possibility then of course we have nova  nova has been confirmed by deadline we  have just not yet received an official  announcement from anybody at marvel  studios yet but d23 is the perfect time  to do that and if it is already being  worked on and planned out that means it  should come in phase 6 so i am fully  expecting a nova announcement they could  even set them up in guardians of the  galaxy vol 